    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Batūmījiwa kūfuma Babuloni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ntemi wa Babuloni, Melodaki-baladani, ng'wana Baladani ūtūma banhū ū kūlī Hezekiya, nguno akigwa gīkī wapīlile kūfuma mu būsaatu, būja na nyalūba n'inong'ho lya kūng'winha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia ūbanukūla na būyegi a batūmījiwa benabo; ūboolekeja ī shikolo shakwe sha mpango, īsho walī abīkile mu numba ya kūbīkīla sabo jakwe; jalīmo feza, zahabu, shisanjo sha mu shilīwa, maguta gawiza, nī shilanga shakwe sha būlūgū ī shose; nīyo pyī ī shikolo īsho walī ibīkīgije ū mu numba yakwe ya kūbīkīla. Ū Hezekia atalekeelile shose shose ū mu numba yakwe nūūlū ū mu būsugi wakwe, īsho ataboolekegije a banhū benabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho, ū ng'hangi Isaya ūja ū kūlī Hezekia ūūkamūja, “A banhū benabo balūhayaga kinehe, na baafumaga halī?” Ū Hezekia ūshosha, “Bafumaga sī ya kūle, bafumaga ma Babuloni banigenihaga nene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'hangi ūbūūja hangī, “Ū ng'wikūlū lyako babonaga mo kī?” Ū Hezekia ūshosha, “Babonaga pyī ī shikolo īsho shilī mu numba y'ikūlū lyane; ū mu shikolo shane shose īsho nabīkile shitīho nūūlū shimò īsho nataboolekegije.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Isaya ūng'wīla ū Hezekia, “Alī lūūlū, gwigwage ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA wa mabità. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Managa gīkī ikanza līkūshika, pyī ī shikolo īsho shilī ng'wikūlū lyako, kwandīja īsho shabilingījiwa na bakūlūgenji bako kwīngīīla kale kūshisha lelo īyī, shikūbūūchiwa shitwalwe Babuloni; shitūsaaga ho shose shose, alīhaya SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma na bamò ba babyalwa bako, abo bafumile mu mininga gako na mīlī gwako bebe ng'wenekīlī, bakūding'wa batwalwe bakasoloolwe babize basese ng'wikūlū lya ntemi wa Babuloni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia ūnshokeja ū Isaya, ūhaya gīkī, “Ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA ūyo wagūyombaga gwene gūtūngīlīgije dūhū.” Nguno wiganikaga, “Ū mu shikū ja būlamu bone īkūbiza mhola na kaholele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
